h37Q28CaQssSnCSIJyokQVUGzvHXkYmz2xLqIj0NBjQHdVFLk3oj98sWkchgKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLntdRJiooSRw6eHAqBrACQ_naBPd0zSscoDPhiaCpzmg&oe=6ABD1557"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LYioGmP28IoQ7kNvwHM9eMU&_nc_oc=AdrlR6MxFzbnb4BUW35EUZhYgYdcL6bOiIlS8Iu1K-tOLC1yffrfh2VJwPCb41BIs4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIVT13dsZ9WzXwf-iczMKsoVsTfAjqsbSe3rKX3eL7c-A&oe=6ABD1361"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J24WqJgbRCgQ7kNvwHD51yr&_nc_oc=AdoTW_FF8SAbhM2BCmjoX_U76ahGSSVll0A3gK9s8fYrx_H2zRidDOiOtdtKWp2lT0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKk9V3fNzgkli_faiV6A_Y8lhIbC7JTvZw0DcYB9Keq4Q&oe=6ABD0197"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sBIvRNvvyPgQ7kNvwFd8D76&_nc_oc=AdqOhIDTiY771fY3Ouf7vQXV7nktWwnJR_s5Q34_MdL4nHvFc5sX-2YmcNR_pQDAgzs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ74N9YKzIocX1BHvPNuqMxcfB5l95A8SRGIHJQ4Del0w&oe=6ABD0822"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6QoURtJwOREQ7kNvwEr4CzR&_nc_oc=AdpFxspmRva8RwdYulzm5yntBd2q4I3n883uX6VAZ_VqTFfpiIqOdzmCxjVE4-_hQAw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJlZqTpc0yHeTkq8TVnbJH5W7tJR8bzvvlANja6AQrXQg&oe=6ABD2CAE"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null